{
 "elemod": 2,
 "id": "tonefx",
 "version": "4.0a",
 "title": "Tone+FX",
 "description": "Tone+FX 4.0: the Tone+FX suite plus ONE dedicated delay line appended at the end of the chain that serves two modes (like digiwave's modes on its own line): WRMZ (a modulated delay) and GRAINZ (a grain-ish cloud of three drifting taps on the same line - no history ring, no head pool). Edited on one DELAYS page (kind 11, the D encoder switches the mode). Params live in a per-pattern block (DGX3) and respond to MIDI CC 80-87. The suite's output ceiling and meter run last. The delay line is mono (widen externally) and true-bypasses when off. It REQUIRES the core (core-dn1 4.0) and does not include it.",
 "category": "Sound",
 "author": "Digital Alchemy DSP",
 "license": "GPL-2.0-or-later",
 "target": {
  "device": "digitone-mk1",
  "product": "Digitone mk1",
  "os": "1.43",
  "syx_sha256": "c5a54cc05b921f2e4bd814834c5365c2a5aa01d7772a9a2961fac1c3095bf9aa",
